{
  "notes": [
    "These are golden test vectors for the a11y/pattern/v1 and a11y/occurrence/v1 profiles.",
    "Every expected_fingerprint value here was computed by running check-fingerprint-vectors.mjs and independently cross-checked with Python hashlib.sha256 over the same RFC 8785 canonical string. None were hand-typed.",
    "Excluded-field vectors (scan date, severity, colour scheme, viewport) are represented structurally: the pattern and occurrence input contracts simply do not define those fields, so a conforming implementation cannot include them in the canonicalized input. There is no separate 'with excluded field' vector because a conforming implementation has no field to put it in.",
    "Do not hand-edit expected_fingerprint or expected_display_id values. Regenerate with review if a new profile version requires new vectors."
  ],
  "pattern_vectors": [
    {
      "id": "PV-01-baseline",
      "description": "Baseline pattern input produces a deterministic fingerprint.",
      "input": {
        "target": { "scope_type": "repository", "scope_id": "https://github.com/example/product" },
        "rule": { "namespace": "axe-core", "id": "color-contrast" },
        "locator": { "type": "css", "normalization_profile": "a11y/css-locator/v1", "value": "#edit-submit" },
        "state_key": null
      },
      "expected_fingerprint": "e7c842e0e569532a337ec96e057ffe58e6e6521a5307c97f16980fdf1e1f43ca",
      "expected_display_id": "A11Y-PAT-E7C842E0E569"
    },
    {
      "id": "PV-02-same-input-same-fingerprint",
